  ("is a tautology). For example, MP (modus ponens) is sound because {A →B, A} |=" 0.1812 0.8730 0.6283 0.6434 0.6434 0.0134 0.00576 0.3907 0.0129 "CQDOTO+CMR12" 0.0151 nil nil 14)
